msgid "AIS (for boats)"
msgstr "AIS（船舶应用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:9 2df0c5e1d9ba4f3da23139c69a09272d
#: 3f427c47332049eb9c8e84758403b87d 4dda2a2a9cc143a1859d335d8e937d3d
#: 6360bd1ab6fd4dd8ac98e0d4690191b5 8e9af178914c46e38cc7c358e052222c
msgid ""
"Rover supports `Automatic identification system (AIS) "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automatic_identification_system>`__ sensors "
"allowing the position of manned boats to be displayed on the ground station"
msgstr ""
"Rover 支持 `自动识别系统（AIS） "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automatic_identification_system>`__ "
"传感器，可在地面站上显示有人驾驶船只的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:11 a17c30cf994c4d8e98b2bab3ee4cc440
msgid ""
"Support for this peripheral is also available for Planes and Copters using "
"the `Custom Firwmare Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ , by "
"creating a firmware build including this feature listed under the IDENT "
"category."
msgstr ""
"通过 `自定义固件构建服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ 为固定翼和多旋翼创建包含该功能的固件（在 IDENT"
" 类别下选择），也可支持此外设。"

