"The AIS_OPTIONS parameter specifies which AIS messages are logged.  These "
"messages are useful for debugging purposes and contain the following "
"information"
msgstr "AIS_OPTIONS 参数指定记录哪些 AIS 消息。这些消息用于调试，包含以下信息"

